Coverpage as homepage
---------------------------------------------------------

Normally, the coverpage and the homepage appear at the same time. Of course, you can also separate the coverpage by [`onlyCover`](#/configuration?id=onlycover) option.

---------------------------------------

* Type: `Boolean|String|String[]|Object`
* Default: `false`

Activate the [cover feature](#/cover). If true, it will load from `_coverpage.md`.

```
window.$docsify = {
  coverpage: true,

  // Custom file name
  coverpage: 'cover.md',

  // multiple covers
  coverpage: ['/', '/zh-cn/'],

  // multiple covers and custom file name
  coverpage: {
    '/': 'cover.md',
    '/zh-cn/': 'cover.md',
  },
};
```

el
---------------------------

* Type: `String`
* Default: `'#app'`

The DOM element to be mounted on initialization. It can be a CSS selector string or an actual [HTMLElement](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement).

```
window.$docsify = {
  el: '#app',
};
```

